Package: quartodown
Title: 'pkgdown'-Style Package Websites Built with 'Quarto'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Date: 2026-08-27
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Bjarke", family = "Hautop Kristensen", email = "bjarke.hautop@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds package websites with 'Quarto', styled to resemble
    'pkgdown'. Because the site is rendered by 'Quarto', all 'Quarto'
    features are supported.
